  "Sözcük veya tırnak içindeki ifadelerle ara. Koşullar birlikte uygulanır.\n\nartist:Metallica\nalbum:\"Bad Apple!!\"\nformat:flac\nyear:1990..2000\nbits:>=24 rate:>=96000\nrating:>=4\nplays:0\nadded:30d\nplayed:never\nfavorite:true\nmissing:true\nduration:<300\n\nSüre saniye, örnekleme oranı Hz olarak yazılır. added:30d son 30 günde eklenenlerdir. -artist:Deneme koşulu dışlar.": "Search words or quoted phrases. Rules are combined.\n\nartist:Metallica\nalbum:\"Bad Apple!!\"\nformat:flac\nyear:1990..2000\nbits:>=24 rate:>=96000\nrating:>=4\nplays:0\nadded:30d\nplayed:never\nfavorite:true\nmissing:true\nduration:<300\n\nDuration is in seconds and sample rate in Hz. added:30d means added in the last 30 days. Use -artist:Example to exclude a rule.",
